      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes, tho red should change too in same way: many people use red status just to get rid of invite spam, but they still want allow people to join on them, especially when watching movies, but at the same time they want to allow friends to join on them.  \nSo hiding location should be separate thing.",
