      "value": "@{5d05a9c7ecd4e80f01170cd3|full_name}: There is a flip side to that though, by sending and invite you are also letting them know that you want to see them. As long as you don't spam invites it shouldn't be a bother. \nIt's a very odd scenario where they really wouldn't need Orange if we could choose to hide our locations as Green or Blue because you would have to send an invite if it displayed as a private world. I would love to know why they chose to add a new colour instead of giving use the ability to hide our location.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
