      "value": "@{5ab3ad272b67505f726c2a8f|full_name}: No, I don't want to hide my location here at all. I just don't want to get any invites when watching movies.\nYour idea could also have uses, but overall its the same thing: just separate hiding location from auto accepting/rejecting invites aka statuses.",
