      "value": "@{5a4aaf7f758fa46d131cd36b|full_name}: Ah I understand what you want now. You want to fully separate everything so that users have full control over their status, invites and privacy. I fear though that in your usage scenario they would just say use Blue because it does exactly what you want. You cant always expect to be in a do not disturb status and also auto accept invites because that would contradict the do not disturb.",
