      "value": "@{5ab3ad272b67505f726c2a8f|full_name}: what? I don't want accept any invite requests, as I would be in friend/friends+ worlds so I would not get any friends requests anyway, as everyone could join.\nI just don't want to get invites from others + do not disturb then works well then that I don't want to be disturbed from watching a movie, but I just don't care if someone will quiet join on me (no request needed as worlds is for friends)\nBasically I just want to be in \"do not disturb\" to show that I'm busy currently to my friends, so they know not to annoy me with dumb avatars but still can join on me if they want to (if I'm in joinable world for them). As with blue one its more like \"I'm open for fun\".\nAs people do join less on you if you use red status compared to green, even if they could join without any issues normally. \nSo I just want normal statuses as they were before + separate option to hide world.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
