      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d05a9c7ecd4e80f01170cd3|full_name}: It was not a mistake, it was a needed feature. Yes, it's a social game, but that doesn't mean every single person in your friends list has to know where you are at all times. You can hang out with a group of people without the rest of your friend list showing up to kidnap you from your current activity. Or maybe one day you feel like meeting new people, who knows. Being able to hide where you are was a necessity just as every single social media app's invisible mode.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
